{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" is a set of patch helpers — one per Origami patch, named after the patch, so an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" becomes a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".drag(…)"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier and an Interaction becomes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".interaction(…)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— plus a gallery of Origami prototypes translated to SwiftUI. The patches are the reusable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part; each entry in the gallery shows those patches composed into a working view. Where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI already has the right tool the translation uses it directly; where it doesn’t, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch helper fills the gap."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Gallery","anchor":"Gallery","type":"heading"},{"items":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"],"style":"detailedGrid","type":"links"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami patterns, rebuilt as SwiftUI you can read — each one a worked example of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patches behind it, so you can see how a prototype’s behavior is written and reach for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same patch on your own layers."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Patterns","anchor":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch"]},{"title":"Patches","anchor":"Patches","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/docu